     <item>
      <title>Version 2.0 (5)</title>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h2>What's New in Version 2.0</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Improved PDF exports</strong> Tables, checklists, and text spacing now mirror Apple Notes formatting even when using the direct database export path.</li>
          <li><strong>Auto export reliability</strong> Scheduled exports use an isolated exporter instance to prevent conflicts, improving background stability.</li>
          <li><strong>General fixes</strong> Better attachment handling and polish throughout the export pipeline.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
